# Created by The Angelo Umali.
# Build context: source only. Never secrets, git history, host installs, media or local agent state.
# Unprefixed patterns match only at the context root, so everything that can appear at any depth carries **/.
.git
.claude
recordings
docker/compose.yml
# Secrets (mirrors .gitignore, plus key material .gitignore leaves to gitleaks)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.secrets.json
**/.npmrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
# Host installs and build output
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.DS_Store
**/claudedocs
# Media, models, partial downloads and local data (mirrors .gitignore)
**/*.[mM][pP]4
**/*.[mM][oO][vV]
**/*.[mM][kK][vV]
**/*.[wW][aA][vV]
**/*.[mM][tT][sS]
**/*.[mM]2[tT][sS]
**/*.[iI][nN][sS][vVpP]
**/*.[lL][rR][vV]
**/*.[wW][eE][bB][mM]
**/*.[aA][vV][iI]
**/*.[mM]4[aA]
**/*.[mM][pP]3
**/*.[aA][aA][cC]
**/*.[fF][lL][aA][cC]
**/*.[hH][eE][iI][cC]
**/media
**/raw
**/*.bin
**/*.part
**/models
**/.models
**/data
**/.data
**/.zks
**/*.gguf
**/*.onnx
**/*.safetensors
